cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper."
type: software
title: "Reproducible Code — Energy Generation Forecasting & Dispatch Optimization"
abstract: >
  Two-stage pipeline for the Valparaíso region of Chile demonstrating
  LSTM-based daily electricity generation forecasting coupled with
  multi-objective linear programming dispatch optimization for simultaneous
  cost and CO₂ emissions minimization.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/felipecarrascog/energy-dispatch-chile"
date-released: "2026-01-13"

